claimed: netty-integration — move okay-netty's suites (TestNetty, TestBackends) out of the default gate into `sbt integrationTest` with the Live tag. They bind real sockets and ports, and TestBackends has now failed the default gate twice with the same signature (jetty StaticException: Closed, 2026-09-01 and 2026-09-03), green in isolation both times. Operator decision, resolving the standing conflict between AGENTS.md's no-flaky-in-the-default-gate policy and BACKLOG's settle-by-investigation plan for netty-ws-matrix-flake.
